	<section_number>58.1-3121</section_number>
	<catch_line>Penalty for false entry in books</catch_line>
	<text>
		If any commissioner knowingly makes a false entry on any of his books, he shall be guilty of malfeasance in office.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 58-889; 1984, c. 675.</history>
</law>
